    "text": "(a) Fix a long link L. What is the homotopy type of the embedding space of\nlinks isotopic to L?\n(b) Fix a link L in a 3-manifold M. What is the homotopy type of the embed-\nding space of links in M isotopic to L?\n\n(c) Given a link $L$ obtained by infecting a link $L_{1}$ by another link $L_{2}$, describe\nthe homotopy type of component of $L$ in the space of links in terms of the\ncomponents of $L_{1}$ and $L_{2}$.",
